### Get active production framework — with constraints
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/partner/framework?client=CLIENT_A&gender=women&season=ss26&category=dresses HTTP/1.1
x-api-key: {{partner-api-key}}

### Get active production framework — missing API key
